# SafeRoute Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your own values. Never commit real credentials.

# TomTom Traffic Flow API key (required for live traffic refresh only)
# The application runs on existing validated static data without this key.
# Never print or expose this value.
TOMTOM_API_KEY=your_tomtom_api_key_here

# Traffic freshness threshold in minutes (default: 180)
SAFEROUTE_TRAFFIC_FRESHNESS_MINUTES=180

# Weather freshness threshold in minutes (default: 60)
SAFEROUTE_WEATHER_FRESHNESS_MINUTES=60
